id: tp-08-the-nooks
number: 108
name: The Nooks
pool: Ordinary
description: Cover with one exit is a coffin. A Lobber in a nook cannot kite, and neither can you.
design: Board topology 8 — an open field lined with one-tile dead ends.
design: Eight nooks are cut into the north and south wall bands. Each has three walls and one mouth, which is exactly what a Husk is for and exactly what a Stalker wants: a body in the mouth seals you in, a shove rams you into the back wall.
retired: its question — "is cover with one exit cover?" — is about to change meaning: see shapes, §5. Re-judge after

spawn l = Lobber
spawn h = Husk
spawn s = Stalker

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

